    "done_when": "per §14's sensor-order node: before any remote call the fenced-worker ssh wrapper from AGENTS.md is on PATH and ssh -o BatchMode=yes jt-60sa hostname answers; reading only, from /analysis/src/getseldata_v4.2 and /analysis/src/SAselene_v2.0_forPSRC on the host or from ingested chunks, the node writes docs/evidence/receipts/jt60sa-selene-sensor-order.json with three ordered lists for flux loops, tangential probes and normal probes, each entry carrying its sensor index, EDDB channel name, geometry-input position and the source file and line range establishing it; ILOOP and IPROB are recorded from the input and each list's length is asserted against them; any order the source does not establish is recorded as unestablished rather than guessed; the fragment summarises the receipt and its sources; the commit has a conventional subject and body; no discover run, no graph write and no file written on the host",
